OL,3,GNEWSARecycling centres to reopen as
OL,4,Ademand eases
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree recycling centres that were
OL,7,Fclosed to cope with the impact of
OL,8,Fpressures on waste sites across the
OL,9,Fcountry are set to reopen.
OL,11,FLeicestershire County Council said the
OL,12,Fsites in Oadby, Lutterworth and
OL,13,FShepshed would reopen over the next
OL,14,Fweek.
OL,16,FIn August, the authority said the
OL,17,Ffacilities were closed due to
OL,18,F"exceptionally high demand" both
OL,19,Flocally and nationally.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
